      56.66,
      118.64,
      514.15,
      172.25
    ],
    "text": "Bulletin No: 04 MSW /26/10/31/01 COLOR: Red Warning for strong winds and rough seas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039999961853027,
      9.960000038146973,
      12.0,
      15.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      56.66,
      172.82,
      379.34,
      217.58
    ],
    "text": "Issued by the Natural Hazards Early Warning Centre Issued at 04.30 p.m. 31 October 2026, valid for the next 24 hours.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599999785423279,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      141.38,
      220.61,
      471.39,
      234.65
    ],
    "text": "For Multi-day boats in the Bay of Bengal deep sea areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      56.66,
      236.24,
      555.49,
      316.49
    ],
    "text": "Take Action! The well-marked low-pressure area over the Southeast Bay of Bengal and adjoining sea areas around the Andaman and Nicobar Islands has now intensified into a depression. At 11.30 a.m. on 31 October 2026, the system was centred near latitude 10.0\u00b0N and longitude 90.2\u00b0E.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.960000038146973,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      56.66,
      333.05,
      555.47,
      418.25
    ],
    "text": "The system is very likely to move west-northwestwards and intensify into a deep depression over the Southeast Bay of Bengal around 11.30 p.m. on 31 October 2026. Continuing to move west-northwestwards, it is very likely to intensify further into a cyclonic storm over the Southeast Bay of Bengal and adjoining areas of the Southwest and West-central Bay of Bengal around 11.30 a.m. on 01 November 2026. Thereafter, it is expected to reach the West-central Bay of Bengal near the Andhra Pradesh coast around 05.30 p.m. on 02 November 2026.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      56.66,
      434.93,
      555.59,
      480.67
    ],
    "text": "Wind speeds in the sea areas marked under the \u201cWarning\u201d category may increase to 70kmph at times, heavy thundershowers can occur, and the sea conditions in these areas will become very rough.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      56.66,
      493.18,
      555.6,
      543.94
    ],
    "text": "Therefore, Naval and fishing communities are warned not to venture to the deep-sea areas bounded by 10N-15N and 80E-90E until further notice. Further, Naval and fishing communities operating in those sea areas are advised to move to safe areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      2.0399999618530273,
      12.0,
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      56.66,
      856.2,
      553.54,
      952.44
    ],
    "text": "Naval and fishing communities engaging the activities over this sea area are advised to be vigilant and be attentive to the future forecasts and bulletins issued by the department of meteorology in this regards.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  }
]